invalid type: string "Section 40. Jurisdiction of civil courts barred in certain matters\n1. No civil court shall entertain suits/proceedings covered by this Act (save as otherwise provided).\n2. The Rent Court's jurisdiction is limited to tenancy agreements submitted under the First Schedule and does not extend to questions of title/ownership.", expected a booleandavit/documents;\nAjYÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ